<title>VENEZUELA: Madosa year net profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Madosa year net profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Net profit 1.3 billion bolivars vs 4.4 billion loss</p>
<p>Revenues 42.0 billion bolivars vs 36.9 billion</p>
<p>Cost of sales 36.3 billion bolivars vs 32.8</p>
<p>Notes: Madosa is a domestic appliances manufacturer.</p>
<p>Period ends September 27, 1996</p>
<p>Results are inflation adjusted in constant September 1996 bolivars</p>
<p>Enron Corp holds a 42 percent share in Madosa. General Electric Co holds 34 percent.</p>
<p>((-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
</text>
